Additional Use Grant:
You may make production use of the Licensed Work to interact with unmodified
Gonka24 Marketplace contracts deployed by the Licensor or with unmodified Deal
contracts instantiated through a Factory deployed by the Licensor. This includes
commercial transactions and operating wallets, user interfaces, indexers and
transaction-submission services that interact with those contracts. You may use,
copy and modify the API definitions and client-interface portions of the Licensed
Work in such integrations.

This Additional Use Grant does not authorize deploying or operating another
production instance of the Marketplace contracts or modified versions of those
contracts, except for Deal instances created through a Factory deployed by the
Licensor as described above. Other production use requires a separate license
from the Licensor until the applicable Change Date. This paragraph does not
restrict the non-production rights granted by the standard BUSL Terms.

First Public Distribution Date: 2026-09-11 (version 0.1.0).
Change Date: 2027-09-11 (version 0.1.0).

For subsequent versions, record their own First Public Distribution Date and
Change Date in the licensing parameters shipped with those versions. The Change
Date is the first anniversary (one calendar year) of that version's first public
distribution by the Licensor under this license.
For a first-publication date of February 29, the Change Date is February 28 of
the following year. A version means an identifiable source revision or release;
public development snapshots are included. Republication, a new tag or version
number for identical material, or a downstream modification does not restart
the original material's period. A later version does not postpone the Change
Date applicable to an earlier version.

